1
00:00:00,068 --> 00:00:02,448
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)All right, team,
open up your practice kits.

2
00:00:02,654 --> 00:00:06,404
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)As the university did not permit me
to bring the equipment we'll be using...

3
00:00:06,574 --> 00:00:11,074
(Sheldon:)...to the Cheesecake Factory,
because apparently, I'm ridiculous...

4
00:00:11,245 --> 00:00:14,875
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)...I've provided substitutes
which will exercise your fine motor skills.

5
00:00:15,041 --> 00:00:18,921
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)Leonard, you will be doing a series
of complex mathematical problems...

6
00:00:19,087 --> 00:00:23,047
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)...on a vintage Casio model 1175
calculator watch I received...

7
00:00:23,216 --> 00:00:26,556
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)...when I won the Earth Science medal
in third grade.

8
00:00:27,553 --> 00:00:29,893
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)Treat it with respect.

9
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:34,390
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)Raj, you will be painting sideburns
and a Vandyke...

10
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:37,560
...on a 6-inch figurine
of Legolas the Elf.

11
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:41,570
Now, remember, a Vandyke
is a goatee without a mustache.

12
00:00:42,568 --> 00:00:46,988
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)Wolowitz, you will be completing a series
of delicate surgical procedures...

13
00:00:47,198 --> 00:00:50,828
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)...on the classic children's game,
Operation.

14
00:00:53,621 --> 00:01:00,021
(Sheldon(pointing at his brain):)To begin with,
you will remove funny bone for $200.

